# The package holds the bundled code, the dashboard, the program for its platform and the media.
# vsce ignores a file that any line ignores unless a line starting with ! includes it, whatever
# the order, so every file to include is named.
**
!package.json
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!LICENSE
!dist/extension.js
!dist/webview/**
!dist/swatches/**
!server/**
!media/icon.png
!media/activity.svg
!media/gauge-dark.svg
!media/gauge-light.svg
!media/walkthrough/**
